00:12:55.407 --> 00:12:58.277
FUTURE WIFE MARIA. HE WAS ACCEPTED INTO STANFORD'S

00:12:58.277 --> 00:13:02.477
GRADUATE ENGINEERING PROGRAM IN 1970 AT STANFORD D'ORO

00:13:03.815 --> 00:13:05.840
EARNED HIS MASTER'S DEGREE IN ELECTRICAL ENGINEERING

00:13:05.840 --> 00:13:08.860
FOCUSED ON COMPUTER ARCHITECTURE AND SEMICONDUCTOR

00:13:08.860 --> 00:13:09.880
SYSTEMS. HE WENT ON TO HOLD INFLUENTIAL

